# Documentation Architecture for MOT Firmware Learning

Plan for creating a well-structured knowledge base inside `MOT/Docs/` to learn firmware repositories one by one, starting from `main()` / `setup()→loop()`.

---

## Proposed Folder Structure

```
MOT/Docs/
├── README.md                          ← Learning roadmap & index
├── Chats/                             ← (existing) exported chat logs
│
├── Architecture/
│   └── MOT_System_Architecture.md     ← Full project overview, wiring, converters
│
├── Firmware/                          ← One sub-folder per firmware repo
│   ├── MOT-ELVH-STM8/                ← Pressure sensor (STM8) — start here
│   │   └── FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md
│   ├── MOT-SHT40-STM8/               ← Temp & humidity sensor (STM8)
│   │   └── FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md
│   ├── MOT-CONTROLLER-CARD/           ← Main PCB (STM32 FreeRTOS)
│   │   └── FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md
│   ├── MOT-STM32-BOOTLOADER/          ← Dual-bank OTA bootloader (STM32)
│   │   └── FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md
│   ├── MOT-SURGEON-DISP/              ← Surgeon display (STM32)
│   │   └── FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md
│   ├── MOT-RGB-SLAVE/                 ← RGB LEDs — Modbus (ESP32)
│   │   └── FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md
│   ├── MOT-RGB-TCP/                   ← RGB LEDs — TCP/WiFi (ESP32)
│   │   └── FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md
│   ├── MOT-RGB-DMX/                   ← RGB LEDs — DMX (ESP32)
│   │   └── FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md
│   └── XRAY-VIEWER-STM8/             ← X-Ray viewer (STM8)
│       └── FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md
│
├── Controllers/                       ← One doc per MCU family
│   ├── STM8.md                        ← STM8S003F3P architecture, memory, registers
│   ├── STM32.md                       ← STM32F407VGTx architecture, memory, HAL
│   └── ESP32.md                       ← ESP32 architecture, Arduino/ESP-IDF
│
├── Protocols/                         ← One doc per protocol
│   ├── I2C.md
│   ├── UART.md
│   ├── SPI.md
│   ├── PWM_Signal.md                  ← PWM as a signal-transfer method
│   ├── Modbus.md
│   ├── RS485.md
│   └── TCP_WiFi.md
│
└── Fundamentals/                      ← Embedded concepts & theory
    ├── PWM.md                         ← Extensive: duty cycle, frequency, dead time…
    ├── ADC.md                         ← Sampling, resolution, reference voltage…
    ├── Polling_vs_Interrupt_vs_DMA.md
    ├── Timers_and_Counters.md
    ├── Clock_System.md
    ├── Memory_and_Registers.md        ← Flash, RAM, EEPROM, reserved bits, volatile
    └── GPIO.md                        ← Push-pull, open-drain, alternate functions
```

